{"id":"steam-1061130","steam":1061130,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Aye Captain!","summary":"In Aye Captain! as a Pirate Captain you recruit and manage crew members, acquire new ships and upgrade them to cross swords and cannons with many other swashbucklers during turn based battles.","about":"ABOUT THE GAME:\n\r\n\r\nAhoy Pirate! \r\n\r\nAye Captain! takes place in the Seven Seas, each dominated by a unique faction. But now the balance is threatened by the Evil Queen of an ever-growing Empire. Plans of her Invasion land in your hands, and so you must gather Allies and strength to face the threat in turn based battles.\r\nWhile exploring a procedurally generated world of the Seven Seas, you may encounter many adventures, treasures, engage in dialogues with wacky characters and trade your loot in some shady places. Yarr!!!\r\n\r\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\r\n\r\n\n• Player driven narrative with witty humor.\r\n• Turn based combat.\r\n• Deep strategic options with unique Loyalty mechanics.\r\n• Beautiful graphics.\r\n• Plenty of Hidden Content to discover.\r\n• Unlock new races, locations, ships, crew mates and much more!\r\n• Every game is different thanks to randomly generated maps & encounters.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/library_600x900.jpg?t=1617798098","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/header.jpg?t=1617798098","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/library_hero.jpg?t=1617798098","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/header.jpg?t=1617798098","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1617798098","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061130/ss_bdec94fbe69ef767e20a28b8351bcbd87805bca9.600x338.jpg?t=1617798098","full":"https://shared.aka